1
00:04:31,578 --> 00:04:37,578
A Cookie Cutter Christmas is a tv movie, comedy,
romance film directed by Christie Will Wolf.

2
00:09:03,157 --> 00:09:09,157
Two longtime rivals and elementary school teachers duke it out during the holidays in a Christmas cookie
bake-off, but their real feud ignites over a shared interest in a handsome single dad.

3
00:13:34,736 --> 00:13:40,736
With both determined to win the prize and the romance, their competitiveness
could jeopardize what matters most this Christmas season.

4
00:18:06,315 --> 00:18:12,315
Christie Reynolds, played by Erin Krakow.

5
00:22:37,894 --> 00:22:43,894
Chef Krueger, played by Alan Thicke.

6
00:27:09,473 --> 00:27:15,473
James, played by David Haydn-Jones.

7
00:31:41,052 --> 00:31:47,052
Penny Miller, played by Miranda Frigon.

8
00:36:12,631 --> 00:36:18,631
Bev Reynolds, played by Laura Soltis.

9
00:40:44,210 --> 00:40:50,210
Lily, played by Genea Charpentier.

10
00:45:15,789 --> 00:45:21,789
Our Little Secret is a 2024 American christmas romantic comedy film
directed by Stephen Herek and written by Hailey DeDominicis.

11
00:49:47,368 --> 00:49:53,368
It stars Lindsay Lohan, alongside an ensemble cast featuring Ian Harding, Tim Meadows, Jon
Rudnitsky, Judy Reyes, Henry Czerny, Chris Parnell, and Kristin Chenoweth.

12
00:54:18,947 --> 00:54:24,947
The film was a part of Lohan's creative partnership with Netflix,
under which she also executive produced the project.

13
00:58:50,526 --> 00:58:56,526
Our Little Secret follows Avery (Lohan), who is spending her first Christmas with her boyfriend's family but
discovers her ex is also part of the holiday festivities and decides to hide their romantic history.

14
01:03:22,105 --> 01:03:28,105
Production began in Atlanta, in January 2024, and
concluded late in the following month.

15
01:07:53,684 --> 01:07:59,684
The film was released on Netflix, on November 27, 2024.

16
01:12:25,263 --> 01:12:31,263
It received mixed reviews from critics and debuted at number one on the streaming
service's most watched films list, where it stayed for two weeks.

17
01:16:56,842 --> 01:17:02,842
The film explores themes of romance, woman director, christmas.

18
01:21:28,421 --> 01:21:34,421
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
